# These are the files git leaves out of the workspace: colcon's build/, install/ and log/
# trees, Python bytecode, and runs/, where the benchmark runners write their logs and summaries
# by default (~/cell_ws/runs). Everything in them is regenerated by a build or a benchmark run.
*.pyc
# AppleDouble files that macOS leaves next to anything copied from it; a stray ._*.xml once
# broke behaviour tree loading in the executor
._*
__pycache__/
build/
install/
log/
runs/
